00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.720
MILLION COLOR!

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.180
TURNS!

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.890
<i>I was forced into a battle on the Lunar Surface.</i>

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:29.400
<i>But by the time I had made it to the Winter Palace...</i>

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.980
<i>...Queen Dianna and Milady Kihel had already reached it together on the Willgem.</i>

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:38.910
<i>Before their watching eyes, and in order to help Harry defend against the Gendarme's attack...</i>

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:42.620
<i>...I ended up releasing a barrier from the White Doll.</i>

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:47.710
<i>I can't even say for sure how I was able to do this.</i>

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:55.260
<b>Guin's Betrayal</b>

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:07.430
Enter.

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.900
Lieutenant Harry, how are you feeling?

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:19.820
That should be rather obvious, Lady Kihel Heim.

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:25.040
I'm wearing Queen Dianna's clothes, and yet you can still tell it's me?

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:28.210
I apologize for turning you into someone's double.

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:31.420
Why's that? There's still some political unease remaining.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:34.420
I'm only feeling happy that I can be of service in this situation.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.510
Are you sure that you'll be alright?

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:42.640
Your fight with the Gendarme seemed to have drained all of your strength.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:46.310
Well, back when we were chatting about the glasses, I was forcing myself to keep active.

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:49.230
But afterwards, I couldn't even keep myself standing.

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:54.610
When that barrier is used, it starts draining the life energy of its pilot.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:57.230
Even though that's the mechanical doll's own function?

00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:00.110
The moment you step inside of it...

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:02.530
...the pilot and the machine no longer function as separate entities.

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:05.700
It's as if the two become one, and then their energy is combined.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.120
Now I understand what you meant.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.420
If you wouldn't mind...

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:19.010
Because of that, the effectiveness of the Barrier Turn A created, as well as the stamina someone like Loran has...

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:21.220
...proves the unit's a danger.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:24.300
I truly can believe that his machine was the one that ended the Dark History.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.100
Can you examine how it functions?

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.520
We wouldn't be able to do so without having to completely dismantle it.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:32.520
I see...

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:37.900
Lieutenant, how are you able to tell the difference between myself and Dianna?

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:43.320
- It's because of the different kind of sorrow that you both display.
- Sorrow?

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:46.530
After Dianna had emerged from her period of sleep...

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:49.540
...over time, I was able to comprehend just how truly sad she felt.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:54.120
As for you, Kihel Heim, you came off as far more energetic.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:59.130
Perhaps it's due to the fact that Queen Dianna and I have both endured many different kinds of hardships.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.300
However, things are different now.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:02.800
In what way?

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:08.510
At this point, you have now begun sharing the burden of Dianna's sadness with her.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:10.520
Lieutenant...

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:26.120
All of these problems were caused by that damned Agrippa!

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:30.120
Without Queen Dianna around, he just freely did whatever he felt like doing!

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:39.130
Hey, I heard that everyone'll soon be able to return to Earth. Is that really true?

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.130
I'm not sure if they decided that yet.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:43.300
It's exactly what one should expect of Queen Dianna!

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.800
The moment she returned, the government was again under her command.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.310
Are they going to awaken everyone in the Winter Palace?

00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:52.020
Not all of them, but about as many people as there is work available for.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.440
Miss Alice and Mr. Fuka should be coming out.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:58.310
Impossible... Are they seriously considering abandoning the hibernation system?

00:04:58.310 --> 00:04:59.610
What's with the crowd?

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:00.820
Let's go see.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.240
Welcome home!

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:05.400
What's going on?

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:08.030
- The hibernation capsules.
- Hibernation capsules?

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:09.910
Is Suzana Riley here?

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.830
Hey, are you looking for Suzana?

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:14.710
- Jamie!
- Sasha, you haven't changed one bit!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:19.340
I see... Has anybody here heard anything about someone named Teteth Halleh?

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.920
Teteth Halleh?

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.920
I think that name sounds oddly familiar...

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.420
My my, Betty, you've aged!

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:29.140
- It looks like over 50 years have passed!
- You haven't changed a bit, Mother.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:33.810
And you still cry as easily as you did when you were a baby. You haven't changed one bit!

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:37.600
Oh, mother, I thought I'd never get a chance to see you again...

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.810
- Miashei, could you please pass me a battery?
- Sure.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:45.240
But I don't get it! Why do they have to stay in the hibernation capsules so long?

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.530
Did they commit some sort of felony?

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:49.910
No, they didn't. This is to keep down the spread of disease that's caused by overcrowding.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:52.830
Are you feeling well now?

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:57.920
Is that it? Now I'm sure you'll end up being the ideal investigative journalist, Fran!

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.420
Thanks.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:02.630
I guess it's true that women become more self confident once they have men...

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.130
Men and women can be quite different, you know.

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:07.220
Joseph is still exactly the same person that he always was, right?

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.130
But as for Loran...

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:12.300
Hmm? So you think he may have a woman now?

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.310
That's not like him!

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:15.430
It's not?

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.960
We'd need detailed drafts if we're going to construct those units.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.580
Those are also available.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:43.880
Don't worry about it.

00:06:45.750 --> 00:06:47.880
And the Lunar Mountain Cycle's data?

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:49.760
It's on the right monitor.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.560
- It won't work?
- Yeah.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:59.480
The Winter Palace data still hasn't been fully copied here.

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:00.980
Ahh, so that's it.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:05.770
However, my Lord, if we can successfully produce mechanical dolls on our own...

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:09.780
...Ameria's scientific advancement will quickly rise to new heights.

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:13.450
After that, we could even fight the against the Moonrace on an even footing.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.580
Just watch us, Moonrace!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:19.370
We're gonna beat your tushes with our own latest and greatest mechanical dolls!

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:23.960
Is it a whale?

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.460
How about this one?

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.380
Don't any of these look like they'd come from the moon?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:30.670
Well, I don't really know what moon merchandise is supposed to look like.

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:32.890
I don't think it should be the whale.

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:34.550
- Ummm...
- What?

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:36.970
Are you people from the Earth?

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:38.680
Yes, we are.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:39.680
I knew it!

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.060
Your clothes are so different!

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:43.270
Our clothes?

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.650
Does Earth have crepes, and noodles?

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.480
You don't eat Chap or Naap, right?

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.360
If you have rain when it's hot out, don't you get burned?

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:53.160
- Huh?
- Are you really six times heavier when on earth?

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.280
I think so...

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:56.370
- Wow!
- Oh Jeez...

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.870
Hey hey, is the war really that big?

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:01.460
What is a Mobile Suit doing in town?

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:06.170
- Ghingnham you idiot!
- What the hell are the cops doing!?

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:44.960
It's Gym Ghingnham! I'm here following the Queen's summons.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:48.960
If I have been called here, there must be some sort of emergency situation.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:53.380
If you wish to be in the presence of the Queen, please relinquish that item on your waist.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:57.680
Hmph... Nonsense. How many times will it take to appease her?

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.760
Such is the law, even if you must do it a million times.

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:04.480
You're as fearsome of a man as you've ever been.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:08.270
Fearsome, you say?... Is that really such a bad thing?

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:11.860
I cannot possibly allow a man such as yourself to utilize the Turn X.

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:15.490
What was that? Is this some sort of joke?

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.660
It's an order from the Queen of the moon.

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.070
Gym Ghingnham...

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:22.660
Hand over the Mobile Suits which were excavated from the Lunar Mountain Cycle!

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.870
Is that what you wanted to say to me?

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:30.090
We were the ones who discovered them!

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:36.680
Besides, who aside from those of us who've governed the military for 2500 years, could properly utilize them?

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.260
Curse you, Gym...

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:41.180
Your people are not the ones who govern the entire army!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.180
You're only one part of it!

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:46.560
What do you think is going to happen if someone like you alone is in charge of the Turn X!?

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:49.560
A member of the House of Ghingnham should understand the consequences!

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:54.280
Have you forgotten that the Ghingnham lineage is the one who's in charge of the Lunar fleet?

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.860
That line of thought is what caused the events of the Dark History!

00:09:58.410 --> 00:09:59.490
Dianna Soriel!

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:01.830
I despise you!

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:06.370
Politicians like yourself only understood things like growing food supplies!

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:08.870
If you're prepared to accept the consequences of assassinating the Queen...

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:11.380
...then go right ahead and kill me, noisy child.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.880
Noisy child!?

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:15.050
Or perhaps you prefer being his puppet?

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.880
You and I are...

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:19.550
Will you allow your feelings to send you down a route into hell?

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:21.260
Into hell?

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:23.850
Or could it be that your life is already hell?

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:25.770
- You bitch...
- Knock it off...

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:26.680
...Merrybell.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:27.560
But she...

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.190
The one who makes the first move will only end up being the loser.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.860
I understand your thoughts on the Turn X...

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.860
But you'll need to come and retrieve it yourself.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:37.360
I thank you, then.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:46.080
Your Majesty, provoking a man like that is both childish and dangerous.

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.450
I'll be careful.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:49.460
Why are you handing over Turn X?

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:50.960
She is our Queen.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.090
Yet we have even greater power!

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.380
Isn't that our way, Gym Ghingnham?

00:10:56.380 --> 00:11:00.970
Are you suggesting that we form a Coup d'etat? The civilians are still supporting Queen Dianna.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:05.560
What's more, my ships aren't meant to be used against this rather delicate city.

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:08.480
I have no intention of destroying this Genganam, which my ancestors had built.

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.060
Who cares about Dianna?

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:11.980
If she's not stopped, Ghingnham...

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.480
Right now, there are two Diannas.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:17.070
At the moment, we can't be sure which of them is the real one.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:19.360
I see!

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.950
It won't work unless we can kill them both!

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:29.660
Learn how to park a car, Terran!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:32.370
Forgive me, Sir Gym Ghingnham...

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.580
Lady Merrybell.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.090
Guin Rhineford?

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:38.960
I am rather pleased that you remember me, Ma'am.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:41.340
And you as well, General of the Moon.

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:13.580
It's just as they said! The goddess of fertility herself blessed us with this cocoa!

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:25.300
Why's it so delicious?

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:27.720
How long have you been listening?

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:34.900
Ma'am! Ever since you licked your cute little lips with that pink tongue...That's when I came in!

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.400
You could have knocked...

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.690
Forgive me! I knocked!

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:40.690
Please forgive me!

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.610
Help yourself, it's fantastic.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:47.410
Thank you for your hospitality.

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:50.620
It's no problem, go right ahead. It's amazing.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:53.580
It smells good...

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:55.080
It is!

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.000
This IS amazing!

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.420
You're pretty amazing yourself.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.800
You mean me?

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:09.390
That's right. It's not just anyone who could have perfectly posed as Dianna Soriel, and even perform the role of the nation's General.

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:12.100
They need to give you some sort of medal.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.520
Thank you very much...

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:16.190
Don't even mention it!

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:19.310
From now on, let's try and become good friends!

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:21.190
Of course, Lady Lily!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:22.900
None of that anymore.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:25.110
Oh, right... Lily.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.410
That's more like it, Kihel.

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:31.490
Hey, check it out! My love for Dianna!

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:34.200
Ooh...Nice work!

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:37.580
I'll bet they'll even let us join Dianna's Royal Guard after this!

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:38.710
Tada!

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.710
Ah! Where did you get those!?

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:45.720
These are a must have if you're going to join the Royal Guard.

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:47.880
Give them to me!

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:52.310
No way, these special near weightless glasses are difficult to find!

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:56.180
- Good morning, sir!
- Good morning.

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:58.310
You two! Prepare the Willgem to set off!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:00.810
- We're departing?
- Where are we heading?

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:03.690
- To earth.
- EARTH!?

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.820
With this technological data we've gained from the moon...

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:10.280
We should now be able to even the balance in our fight against the Moonrace!

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:15.410
Your Lordship, we understand what Yanni's saying, but this war is...

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:20.710
Actually, the war will not go as simply as the Sergeant has implied.

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:23.300
But we understand their technology now!

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.300
But you need to have the capacity to produce it, as well!

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:27.510
And that's precisely why we now must return to Earth.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:30.090
Make sure our supply of condensing gel is full.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:31.220
Sir!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.180
- Oh, and also...
- Sir?

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:36.180
Have somebody bring Laura.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.600
Just Loran? Any other pilots?

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:41.610
Nope, just Laura.

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:44.400
Guin Rhineford...

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:49.700
He said he wanted me to devote myself to studying the entirety of the Dark History... however...

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.410
He's over here.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.200
Senior Sid...

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:56.910
Hello, Lady Dianna.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:59.210
I wanted to speak with you.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.000
Yes?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.210
I'd like Loran to take the White Doll and head for the Ghingnham Space fleet.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:07.010
Ghingnham's fleet? Why there?

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:09.220
To reclaim the Turn X.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:12.090
I think Loran was just heading off towards the Willgem.

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.890
Have you tried contacting the Willgem?

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:18.020
Guin was also looking for him.

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.600
It's odd...

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.400
Hey, you came at the perfect time, Laura.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.480
Come and join our victory celebration.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.490
What celebration?

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:32.990
Yes. We'll be celebrating even more if we get this thing back to Earth.

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:36.120
It's amazing how well we've done after coming to the Moon so unprepared, don't you think?

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.790
Ahh, allow me to introduce you.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:42.290
This lady is from the House of Ghingnham. Her name is Merrybell.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.000
My name is...

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.580
Loran Cehack.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:46.800
This isn't our first meeting.

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:48.880
Aren't you the pilot of the Mustached Mechanical Doll?

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.090
That's right.

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:54.300
And you're also from the Moonrace?

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:55.800
What of it?

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:58.100
Sir Guin!

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:00.680
The Willgem?

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:02.190
What's going on here?

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:04.900
We told you that Guin Rhineford invited you to celebrate with us.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.610
Didn't you already ask this?

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:14.610
Did you speak to Queen Dianna about this?

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:16.700
Is everyone else already onboard?

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:20.120
I didn't want to return to Earth yet!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:22.710
Everybody who we need to pilot this ship is onboard.

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:28.920
And both of my masters?

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:30.090
The other crew members?

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:32.720
There're quite a few people who still aren't on board!

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.380
This is a ship of the Militia.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:36.800
It's simply an unfortunate chance that they weren't here when we had to depart.

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:38.100
Just by chance?

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.810
Then why did you make a point of having me come aboard first?

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:43.600
Laura, you're the pilot of the White Doll.

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:46.900
Who else would we want to become the commander of the Militia's mechanical doll division?

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:49.610
My name is...

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.110
Loran!

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:56.780
Guin Rhineford is about to repeat yet another terrible mistake...!

00:16:57.280 --> 00:16:58.280
Laura...

00:16:58.280 --> 00:17:00.990
We want to prevent Earth from being overthrown and ruled by men like Agrippa!

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:03.120
I will not help you repeat the Dark History!

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:06.710
But the Dark History also has many wonderful things to teach us!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:08.210
That boy...

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:09.590
Lady Merrybell...

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.590
Let go of me!

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:14.090
I want to return to Dianna...

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:16.590
And I want to go back to Milady Kihel and Milady Sochie!

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:19.100
What's the Bandit doing here!?

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:23.520
Let me use your Radio.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:24.390
Is it about Loran?

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.020
Adjust this frequency...

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.900
We're busy here, stop this!

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:30.320
Lord, what's going on around here?

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.320
We have an agreement with Gym Ghingnham.

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:34.820
Don't interfere with Merrybell.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.110
But...

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:37.910
This... aah!

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.490
What's going on, Loran?

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:43.410
Return this ship to the moon.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:46.710
Otherwise, I'll open fire on you and that girl!

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:48.920
Don't make threats you can't carry out, Laura.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:50.500
Go ahead and shoot!

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.800
I can still push your ship back!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:17:59.590
Loran...

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:02.390
...actions like this could become the grounds for a court martial!

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:05.520
Has Guin become the lone commander of the Militia now?

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.120
That's...

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:30.210
You blew it, Sir Guin Rhineford.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:32.210
What's going on here?

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.500
Turn X and Guin?

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:36.880
Have you joined forces with Gym Ghingnham?

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:39.380
This is a matter of politics, Laura.

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:41.890
I will now return to the earth together with Sir Gym...

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:45.600
The earth will then revert back to an era of scientific advancements!

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:48.520
The continents of Gauria, Efrico, Ezia...

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:50.900
...eventually, we'll grant all of these places the technology of the Moonrace...

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:52.900
...and then we'll finally return to a period of thriving civilization!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:55.480
Lord Guin, do you have any idea what you're saying?

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:57.610
I don't understand it!

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:04.700
Dianna Soriel is nothing more than a tiny ape who ran when burned by the Dark History's flames.

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.410
How dare you...!

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:09.710
Look at them, the Moonrace who have forgotten how to fight for themselves...

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:14.000
Their culture has died, and they let history pass as they no longer create anything new!

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.300
However...

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:18.590
Guin has shown me something.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:21.010
There are taboos on creativity...

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:25.600
However, because Dianna herself has broken these taboos...

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:29.680
- It's all my fault! If only I didn't download the Dark History's data for him...

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:29.680
...There's no longer any need for the House of Ghingnham to protect her!

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:33.690
These foolish people who would repeat the Dark History...

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:36.690
Can't they see the consequences of what they intend to do?

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:39.110
If you're unwilling to listen to my words, then...

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:41.910
Mustache... We'll end this!

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:53.000
Does he seriously want to do this!?

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.220
These units are brothers, so they should be evenly matched, right?

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:05.890
Why?

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:07.890
Shouldn't Turn A be the Turn X's older brother?

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:15.690
Now I see! So THIS is the Shining Finger!

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.190
Sir Gym Ghingnham...

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.480
You want me to let Laura survive, correct?

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:22.110
That's right. Surrender to us Laura...

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:24.610
...and then I will beg for Sir Gym here to spare you.

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:28.990
Can I fight him without having to kill him?

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.700
What are you doing? Fight me!

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:39.590
Then...!

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:48.220
What!?

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:58.610
Is THAT why it's called the Turn X?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.110
It can spread itself apart?

00:21:03.900 --> 00:21:05.490
As I was saying...

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:07.700
...the other sibling was granted even more capabilities!

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:12.290
X was meant to supplement the Turn A, Laura Rola!

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:28.300
I have to escape...

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:34.020
Turn A... your mission is over.

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:37.520
Eject!

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:49.990
Hmph! However...

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:54.910
...If that unit couldn't play little tricks like that one, it wouldn't be a worthy of being the Turn X's brother!

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:06.510
Let us head for the earth.

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:08.590
I'll be satisfied with that.

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:11.720
The earth is our home ground, after all.

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:37.540
<b><i>Yama no ha tsuki wa michi</i></b>

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:37.540
<b>As the full moon, casts itself over the mountain's edge...</b>

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:44.590
<b><i>iki zuku anata no mori</i></b>

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:44.590
<b>...it spreads the breath of life spreads into the forest where you stand...</b>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:51.720
<b><i>Natsu kusa abite nemuru</i></b>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:51.720
<b>As you sleep in the summer grass...</b>

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:58.600
<b><i>Itooshii yokogao</i></b>

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:58.600
<b>...your profile is a lovely sight to behold.</b>

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:06.690
<b><i>Kaze ni</i></b>

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:06.690
<b>The wind...</b>

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.780
<b><i>LaLaLu... LaLaLu...</i></b>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:20.670
<b><i>utae... hane ni</i></b>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:20.670
<b>The sight of your wings, is seen...</b>

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:25.170
<b><i>tsuki utsushi</i></b>

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:25.170
<b>...in the moon's reflection.</b>

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:32.800
<b><i>Inochi kagaya kase yo</i></b>

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:32.800
<b>This wonderful life will shine vividly.</b>

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:40.770
<i>It was quite a surprising event.</i>

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:44.440
<i>Sir Guin has chosen to accompany Gym's fleet back to the earth.</i>

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:47.730
<i>Queen Dianna wishes to prepare and pursue them...</i>

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:50.820
<i>...but the Ghingnham forces that remained behind attack us before we can depart.</i>

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:52.950
<i>As Lieutenant Harry fights to defend us...</i>

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:55.370
<i>...I enter combat by using the Core Fighter.</i>

00:23:57.740 --> 00:24:01.460
<i>Next time... on </i>Turn A Gundam...<i>
Again, To Earth</i>

00:24:02.460 --> 00:24:04.040
"The wind has turned back."

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:07.460
<b>Again, To Earth</b>
